<title>UK: Walker Greenbank finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>Walker Greenbank finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wallcoverings manufacturer Walker Greenbank said on Monday that its finance director M C Hynes has resigned effective August 31.</p>
<p>A brief statement to the stock exchange did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
